  "changes": [
    "Outcome caveats no longer negate an independently requested geometry operation; same-clause actual prohibitions and uncertainty remain effective.",
    "Fixed/initial/hash expressions require geometry context, preventing fixed random seed text from becoming an independent geometry obligation.",
    "General-intake preflight aggregates existing default adoption checks, exact field quote and lexical/source diagnostics, and newly unsupported input minimum-evidence notice requirements; final guards remain active.",
    "Ambiguous quotes report an exact schema path, total matching occurrence count and up to eight message IDs/derived offsets/context snippets. Reusing one message ID cannot distinguish two occurrences; diagnostic offsets do not become writable schema authority.",
    "Existing solvent-context target exclusion also recognizes a named environment, so C-PCM water environment does not manufacture a water-molecule energy goal."
  ],
